      229.19
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE MATERNITY BENEFITSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 140)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      246.05,
      401.9,
      271.43
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      288.29,
      401.89,
      313.79
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Maternity Benefits(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      330.65,
      401.92,
      384.23
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 3 of the Maternity Benefits Ordinance(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended by the insertion of subsection (1) (c) and (1) (d) ofthat section, as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.89,
      401.09,
      401.87,
      440.63
    ],
    "text": "''(c) seven days from the date of miscarriage, if themiscarriage occurs in the first twenty eight weeksof pregnancy; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      181.05,
      457.49,
      401.88,
      482.99
    ],
    "text": "(d) seven days from the date of termination ofpregnancy under medical grounds''.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      499.85,
      401.89,
      525.23
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
